{"id":"vod_sn_36303","vodId":"36303","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"假面骑士时王","name_cn":"假面骑士时王","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第49集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/4a2eda8b1dbd03387d3e517f664a9fdb.jpg"},"summary":"《假面骑士Zi-O》（原文：仮面ライダージオウKamen Rider Zi-O）是2018年播出的日本特摄电视剧，也是“平成假面骑士”系列第20作，是“平成假面骑士”20周年的完结作品。Zi-O使用变身腰带“时空驱动器”，并装上变身道具“驾驭表头”变身。而且，能透过获得蕴藏着历代平成假面骑士力量的驾驭表头，将其力量解放，便能够穿上各平成骑士的装甲。这样，能够使用全部平成假面骑士力量的Zi-O，简直就是拥有从2000年开始“平成假面骑士”20部作品力量的超级英雄！自此，平成最后一位假面骑士的故事开始了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:42:04","playable":true,"episodeCount":47,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3fXhcSJka51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/a6eWWVaF9g1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qNRf6CuzGS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8ADqCxPf7y1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DcYXZHZFzj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rzxxd754jL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/V9J5A9Khuf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cpPvqMxqw31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0jkJYiiKZj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/NiXYvmhei91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/U5Tawm2JKb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gJJd9smE1b1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rXLukTSjrH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mL6CCW0LwR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.co